ningful boundary, and whether enforcing that boundary mattered. He challenged City on the pitch. He questioned the system around them. Now those questions have new context, while the consequences are still being decided. Ninety-seven points once looked like a story about falling short. It remains a remarkable season. The debate about what surrounded it is far from finished.", "voice_id": "bu5eKETbFKC8G702EAU4", "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2"}